 meetings are not welcome."],"jaJP":["ここで終わらせます"]},"keys":["cv_twins_android_Skill1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/632/6320012@-5528022663170868179"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/632/6320012"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/632/6320012@-2375516153522874709"]},"audioName":"6320012"},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["陈年数据，一概删除。"],"enUS":["Removing outdated data."],"jaJP":["旧式は排除です！"]},"keys":["cv_twins_android_Skill2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/632/6320013@8369846079103686078"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/632/6320013"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/632/6320013@-3421924428860685317"]},"audioName":"6320013"},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["检测到系统损坏。"],"enUS":["Damage detected."],"jaJP":["損傷あり"]},"keys":["cv_twins_android_Damaged1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/632/6320014@-5909671995248946146"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/632/6320014"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/632/6320014@-6269493246873559385"]},"audioName":"6320014"},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["危险。"],"enUS":["It's dangerous."],"jaJP":["危険です"]},"keys":["cv_twins_android_Damaged2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/632/6320015@-896566252242252864"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/632/6320015"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/632/6320015@3901435026608317423"]},"audioName":"6320015"},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["做出这样的选择，并不会让你成为完美的存在。"],"enUS":["Making that choice does not make you a perfect being."],"jaJP":["その選択は、あなたが完璧な存在である証明にはなりません"]},"keys":["cv_twins_android_PlayerChooseBright"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/632/6320016@7570665423860167499"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/632/6320016"]